BA_ "Description" SG_ 983 BLTN_CAM_SWVerMajor "Indicate the Built-in Cam software version as follows:
- The software version is displayed in seven digits.
- The Major, Minor1, Minor2, Minor3 digits are separated by '.'
- Major Signal value is transmitted to ASCII codes.
- Minor1/Minor2/Minor2 Signal values are transmitted to unsigned integer(2digit).
- Major version has 2 charactors, the first charactors must be '0'

¡Ø Example
BLTN_CAM_SwVerMajor : 0x41 (HEX) -> ASCII CODE : 'A' 
BLTN_CAM_SwVerMinor1 : 0x01 (HEX) -> unsigned int : 01
BLTN_CAM_SwVerMinor2 : 0x0A (HEX) -> unsigned int : 10
BLTN_CAM_SwVerMinor3 : 0x47 (HEX) -> unsigned int : 71
=> BLTN_CAM S/W Ver is displayed '0A.01.10.71'";
BA_ "GenSigSendType" SG_ 983 BLTN_CAM_SWVerMajor 4;
BA_ "GenSigStartValue" SG_ 983 BLTN_CAM_SWVerMajor 0;
