BA_ "Description" SG_ 2399390209 CLU_ThemeOpt "It is for showing whether each Theme option is applied or not
If option is applied, each bit transmitt value '1'
1) bit0 : New theme Type(classic A/B/C etc) is applied(1) or not (0)
2) bit1 : Theme A (Classic A) is applied(1) or not (0)
3) bit2 : Theme B (Classic B) is applied(1) or not (0)
4) bit3 : Theme C (Classic C) is applied(1) or not (0)
5) bit4 :Theme D (Cube/Dynamic) is applied(1) or not (0)
6) Except: Reserved(Default bit value : '0')";
BA_ "GenSigStartValue" SG_ 2399390209 CLU_ThemeOpt 0;
