If kick-down switch isn¡¯t connected to engine ECU directly, ECU can recognize the positive action of a driver from accel pedal position indirectly.
When current vehicle speed exceeds the limit speed, vehicle reaction should be distinguished (e.g. lamp reaction or audio warning signal reaction) depending on the status of ¡°CF_Ems_SldPosAct¡±";
