BA_ "Description" SG_ 2214658049 ENG_BattDscnctSta "The signal specifies that ECU has detected a disconnection of the battery since last driving cycle, and therefore has reset the adaptive values and failure memory.
If the EMS does not support this signal the value is 00H

The failure memory erasure is activated only if the calibration C_CONF_NVMY_RST is set to 1 inside the EMS.";
