BA_ "Description" SG_ 2277634049 EPB_Crc1Val "The data area for CRC calculation is based on the data length (DLC) of the message DB.
The CRC shall be calculated over the entire data block (excluding the CRC bytes) including the user data, alive counter and Data ID
 
- CRC Polynomial (0x1021) , Initial Value : 0xFFFF, XOR value : 0x0000, Data ID : Message ID + 0xF800 
- The initial value is for CRC calculation and the message should be sent with the calculated result value. 
- The mathematical expression to 16 bit CRC polynomial is given here. G(x) = x16 + x12 + x5 + 1";
BA_ "GenSigStartValue" SG_ 2277634049 EPB_Crc1Val 65535;
BA_ "UserSigValidity" SG_ 2277634049 EPB_Crc1Val 3;
BA_ "NetworkRequestHoldingTime" SG_ 2277634049 EPB_Crc1Val 0;
BA_ "RoutingFactor" SG_ 2277634049 EPB_Crc1Val 3;
BA_ "Version" SG_ 2277634049 EPB_Crc1Val "18.11.08";
BA_ "Description" SG_ 2277634049 EPB_AlvCnt1Val "For the first transmission request for a data element the counter shall be initialized with 0 and shall be incremented by 1 for every subsequent send request. 
When the counter reaches the maximum value(0xFF), then it shall restart with 0 for the next send request";
BA_ "GenSigStartValue" SG_ 2277634049 EPB_AlvCnt1Val 0;
BA_ "UserSigValidity" SG_ 2277634049 EPB_AlvCnt1Val 3;
BA_ "NetworkRequestHoldingTime" SG_ 2277634049 EPB_AlvCnt1Val 0;
BA_ "RoutingFactor" SG_ 2277634049 EPB_AlvCnt1Val 3;
BA_ "Version" SG_ 2277634049 EPB_AlvCnt1Val "18.11.08";
BA_ "Description" SG_ 2277634049 EPB_LmpStaDis "This signal indicates status lamp request from EPB to lamp control unit.
- If a lamp control unit can not get this signal via CAN due to any errors, the last lamp state before the error should be maintained.
- When EPB apply switch is pressed in the IG-key off sate, the parking brake lamp should be on for 15 seconds and off. In this case, the cluster shall have CAN wake-up capability.

EPB_LmpStaDis(0H) - Parking brake lamp status (Off)
EPB_LmpStaDis(1H) - Parking brake lamp status (On)
EPB_LmpStaDis(2H) - Parking brake lamp status (Blinking at 1Hz)";
BA_ "GenSigStartValue" SG_ 2277634049 EPB_LmpStaDis 0;
BA_ "UserSigValidity" SG_ 2277634049 EPB_LmpStaDis 3;
