BA_ "Description" SG_ 2277634049 EPB_AlrmReq "This signal indicates that an EPB requests cluster or tone controller to ring the alarm according to the status of an EPB.

Conversion [Condition]
0H : Normal operation
1H : EPB_CLU = 2 or 3
(send signals three time in a row & 1st signal should be sent at the same time as corresponding EPB_CLU 1st Signal)
2H : Dynamic braking[ECD, RWU] (send signal continuously)
3H : Reserved";
