BA_ "Description" SG_ 2172674050 TCS_Req "Request for an indicated desired engine torque, the combination of signals calls, on the one hand, for a desire for charge reduction (TCS or ESC function), and, on the other hand, for a desire for charge increase (MSR function).

TCS_REQ : Identifies a TCS control or ESC control intervention. This bit is to prevent the triggering of unintended TCS/ESC interventions.

TCS function:
In the case of a torque reduction, following conditions must be fulfilled. : 
TCS_REQ=1, MSR_C_REQ=0, TQI_TCS < 0FFH and TQI_MSR = 00H

MSR function :
 In the case of a torque increase, following conditions must be fulfilled. : 
 MSR_C_REQ = 1, TCS_REQ = 0, TQI_MSR > 00H and TQI_TCS = 1¡¯s complement of TQI_MSR";
BA_ "GenSigStartValue" SG_ 2172674050 TCS_Req 0;
BA_ "UserSigValidity" SG_ 2172674050 TCS_Req 3;
BA_ "NetworkRequestHoldingTime" SG_ 2172674050 TCS_Req 0;
BA_ "RoutingFactor" SG_ 2172674050 TCS_Req 5;
BA_ "Version" SG_ 2172674050 TCS_Req "17.12.00";
BA_ "Description" SG_ 2172674050 MSR_FuncReq "Request for an indicated desired engine torque, the combination of signals calls, on the one hand, for a desire for charge reduction (TCS or ESC function), and, on the other hand, for a desire for charge increase (MSR function).

MSR_C_REQ : Identifies an engine drag torque control for which fuel cut off prohibition is specified.

TCS function:
In the case of a torque reduction, following conditions must be fulfilled. : 
TCS_REQ=1, MSR_C_REQ=0, TQI_TCS < 0FFH and TQI_MSR = 00H

MSR function :
 In the case of a torque increase, following conditions must be fulfilled. : 
 MSR_C_REQ = 1, TCS_REQ = 0, TQI_MSR > 00H and TQI_TCS = 1¡¯s complement of TQI_MSR";
BA_ "GenSigStartValue" SG_ 2172674050 MSR_FuncReq 0;
BA_ "UserSigValidity" SG_ 2172674050 MSR_FuncReq 3;
BA_ "NetworkRequestHoldingTime" SG_ 2172674050 MSR_FuncReq 0;
BA_ "RoutingFactor" SG_ 2172674050 MSR_FuncReq 5;
BA_ "Version" SG_ 2172674050 MSR_FuncReq "17.12.00";
BA_ "Description" SG_ 2172674050 TCS_GearShftCharacteristicVal "Interface signal between TCS/ESC and TCU influencing the TCU switching characteristics in the case of an TCS control system.";
BA_ "GenSigStartValue" SG_ 2172674050 TCS_GearShftCharacteristicVal 0;
BA_ "UserSigValidity" SG_ 2172674050 TCS_GearShftCharacteristicVal 3;
