BA_ "Description" SG_ 2172674051 ESC_CylPrsrDiagSta "This signal indicates self-diagnosis mode of master cylinder pressure signal. During system check, master cylinder pressure information cannot be sent(not available) and this bit should be set to 1.";
BA_ "GenSigStartValue" SG_ 2172674051 ESC_CylPrsrDiagSta 1;
