BA_ "Description" SG_ 2172674051 ESC_CylPrsrFlagSta "This signal means that the pressure of master cylinder is 15 bar or over.
(0x0 : under 15 bar, 0x1 : 15 bar or over)

This signal may be difference with actual BLS(Brake Lamp Switch) state.
So the ESC does not guarantee using this signal as substituting the BLS.
(If any problem is happened in other ECU, ESC does not cope with it)

And the other ECUs receiving this signal have to check the value of CYL_PRES_STAT.
If the CYL_PRES_STAT signal's value is invalid, other ECUs do not use this signal to control parameter.(This signal is invalid, too)";
