BA_ "Description" SG_ 2172674051 ESC_StrTqReq "Requested additional Assist torque of MDPS gets from ESC to make vehicle more stable.

Relationship between signals:
ESC_StrTrqReq = 0 Nm  ( DST inactive )
-> ESC_DstAct = 0, ESC_DstCtrMode = 0
ESC_StrTrqReq < 0 Nm  or  ESC_StrTrqReq > 0 Nm  (active DST intervention)
-> ESC_DstAct = 1, ESC_DstCtrMode = 1";
