BA_ "Description" SG_ 2164278530 HTCU_VehSpdKphVal "The vehicle speed calculated by HTCU is transferred.
If a vehicle has no vehicle speed sensor, no wheel speed sensor and no ABS(ESC) then it is impossible for an EMS to calculate veficle speed. In this case a HTCU should calculate vehicle speed and send to other ECUs.
The calculation can be done with output speed of gearbox, final gear ratio and fixed actual radius of a tire.";
