BA_ "Description" SG_ 2176872449 HDCT_OBDSta "The signal HDCT_ObdSta is used to inform the OBD master (EMS-ECU) in case a OBD relevant fault is detected. According to the OBD regulations the HTCU could request MIL on, MIL blinking and freeze frame storage. If a freeze frame request by the HTCU has not been acknowledged (CF_Ems_ObdFrfAck) within 2 seconds, this request has to be canceled.
Value description
Bit 0: readiness info / Bit 1: freeze frame request / Bit 2: MIL on request / Bit3: MIL blinking request";
BA_ "GenSigStartValue" SG_ 2176872449 HDCT_OBDSta 0;
BA_ "UserSigValidity" SG_ 2176872449 HDCT_OBDSta 3;
