BA_ "Version" SG_ 2176872449 HDCT_OBDSta "19.10.01";
BA_ "Description" SG_ 2176872449 HDCT_OBDErrSta "Informs about the presence of an OBD-relevant error in the HTCU.
When an OBD-relevant error detected HDCT_ObdErrSta is set to 1 and the related DTC(s) would be recorded into non-volatile memory. Even if the error is not detected currently, HDCT_ObdErrSta should be set to 1 as long as DTC exists in memory.";
BA_ "GenSigStartValue" SG_ 2176872449 HDCT_OBDErrSta 0;
