BA_ "Description" SG_ 1043 Lamp_LedHdLmpSta "This signal is LED headlamp status inform whether LED fail or not which is regulation of ECE, Domestic.

If LED H/Lamp detects LED failure then a cluster shall be turn on to 'LED' indicator in the display panel and It should be to display the words 'Check LED Head Lamp!' on the LCD panel in the cluster module.
 
If LED H/Lamp detects FAN failure then a cluster shall be turn on 'LED' indicator in the display panel and It should be to display the words 'Check LED Head Lamp¡¯s FAN!' on the LCD panel in the cluster module.('LED' Indicator not blink)

1) Priority is higher LED failure than FAN failure.
2) 'LED' indicator off when Normal Conditions.";
