BA_ "Description" SG_ 2164279810 IMU_YawRtVal "This signal indicates Information regarding yaw rate.

physical range : -163.84..163.83 ¢ª/s = 0000H..FFFEh

Conversion : (PH) = ((HEX)-8000H)*0.005[¢ª/s/digit]

                            = (HEX)*0.005[¢ª/s/digit] - 163.84[¢ª/s]

                     FFFFh = Error 

Physical range and the resolution applied to the conversion rules may differ from the actual sensor specifications specified in the ES95920-75.

