BA_ "Description" SG_ 208 RR_SHVU_DTCdisplay "0x00: DTC is not exist(Fail is not exist)/0x01:IGN2 Fuse Open Detection/0x02:Switch Input Detection at Same Time/0x03:NTC/Heating wire Open Detection/0x04:NTC+/NTC- Terminal Short Detection/0x05:NTC+/Heater+ Terminal Short Detection/0x06:NTC+/Heater-, Heater+/Heater-, Heater+/NTC- Terminal Short Detection/0x07:NTC+/Heater- Wiring Short Detection/0x08:NTC+/Heater-, Heater+/Heater-, Heater+/NTC- Wiring Short Detection/0x09:Target Temperature Dissatisfied/0x0A:Blower+/Blower- Short, Blower+/Blower Speed, Blower-/Blower Speed Wiring Short Detection/0x0B:Blower+/Blower RPM, Blower-/Blower RPM, Blower Speed/Blower RPM Short Detection/0x0C:Blower+, Blower-, Blower Speed Signal open Detection/0x0D:Blower RPM signal Open Detection/0x0E~0xFD:Unused/0xFE:No Display/0xFF:Invalid";
