BA_ "Description" SG_ 2164277252 IMT_CltchPdlPos "Clutch Position Sensor value for 3 pedal IMT system.
This value is not supported by 2 pedal IMT system.

0% means pedal off 
99.21875% (0xFE) means pedal fully pressed
99.609375 (0xFF) means  error";
