BA_ "Description" SG_ 2164277252 DCT_TqIncReq "An Identifier of a DCT TCU controller for increasing torque intervention. 
This bit is to prevent the triggering of unintended DCT TCU interventions.

In the case of a torque increase, following conditions must be fulfilled.
DCT_TqIncReq = 1 and TCU_EngTqIncReqVal > 00H.";
BA_ "GenSigStartValue" SG_ 2164277252 DCT_TqIncReq 0;
BA_ "UserSigValidity" SG_ 2164277252 DCT_TqIncReq 3;
BA_ "NetworkRequestHoldingTime" SG_ 2164277252 DCT_TqIncReq 0;
BA_ "RoutingFactor" SG_ 2164277252 DCT_TqIncReq 5;
BA_ "Version" SG_ 2164277252 DCT_TqIncReq "18.08.02";
BA_ "Description" SG_ 2164277252 DCT_CrpTqReq "During creep mode (engine in idle, brake pedal not pressed, gear engaged) clutch torque will be applied. In order to support the engine¡¯s idle controller DCT_CrpTqReq gives the information how much clutch torque will be applied within the next 50 ms.";
BA_ "GenSigStartValue" SG_ 2164277252 DCT_CrpTqReq 512;
BA_ "UserSigValidity" SG_ 2164277252 DCT_CrpTqReq 3;
BA_ "NetworkRequestHoldingTime" SG_ 2164277252 DCT_CrpTqReq 0;
